re-work.md

# ── Nothing generated is committed (PRINCIPLES #10) ─────────────────────────
# dist/ is built by `npm run build:css` and published from CI on a tag.
dist/

# docs/ currently holds BOTH the generator (docs/_build/) and its output.
# Everything under docs/ is generated except the five paths re-included below;
# `npm run docs` rebuilds the rest. Phase 5 splits this properly into
# docs/ = source and site/ = output.
docs/*
!docs/_build/
!docs/preview.css
!docs/preview.js
!docs/favicon.svg
!docs/og.png

# Built docs output, once Phase 5 lands.
site/
